    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In our company context, we have experience with public procurement in various jurisdictions, including Italy, France, Germany, Belgium, and EU institutions. we are also aware of the French Code Commande Publique. we subcontracting policy ensures that all subcontractors must be EU-established, and we have a vetting process in place that includes legal and financial due diligence as well as exclusion grounds checks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding intellectual property, we default IP model is work-for-hire, where all deliverables are transferred to the client upon final payment. we also have source code escrow capability with Logitas (France) as we escrow provider." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we have an open-source licence audit process and use standard licenses such as Apache 2.0, MIT, and LGPL v2.1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Concerning liability and insurance, we have a limitation of liability standard of EUR 3,000,000, professional indemnity insurance of EUR 5,000,000, and cyber liability insurance of EUR 2,000,000, with AXA XL as we insurance provider. we policy is valid until December 31, 2025." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of GDPR compliance, we have a Data Protection Agreement (DPA) template version 3.2, and we standard legal basis for processing personal data is Article 6(1)(e) – performance of task in public interest. we do not process sensitive data by default, but we can support Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs) if needed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these aspects, the legal risks associated with this project include ensuring GDPR compliance, particularly with regards to data protection and explicability of recommendations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, based on our company context, we are compliant with the necessary regulations. we have the necessary expertise in EU AI Act, prohibited AI practices awareness, limited risk AI transparency obligations, and human oversight contractual enforcement. we also have a no-automated-decision-without-human-validation policy in place, which aligns with the client's requirement for explicit validation of an agent for automated decisions. we standard contractual clauses include a termination for cause notice period, termination for convenience notice period, data return on termination, and data destruction certificate, which can be tailored to meet the client's specific needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
