    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution requires an intelligent assistance tool to assist agents in agents daily missions, with capabilities such as search for information, help with drafting, and suggestion of actions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy do we propose to meet these requirements, and what are the potential trade-offs?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the client's requirements, we propose leveraging we expertise in large language models (LLMs) and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities. we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be fine-tuned to provide contextualized answers and assist with drafting administrative contents. we can also utilize we experience with RAG to enable the search for information in internal procedures and applicable regulation. we innovation strategy involves deploying a combination of natural language processing (NLP) and information retrieval techniques to develop an intelligent assistance tool. an intelligent assistance tool will be designed to accompany agents in agents administrative activities, provide help with drafting letters or answers to users, and suggest actions or steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process. we will also draw on we knowledge graph capabilities, currently under research, to potentially enhance an intelligent assistance tool ability to understand the context of ongoing files and facilitate continuity of processing between agents and services. we current research topics include knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning and multi-agent collaboration frameworks, which may be relevant to this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we must consider potential trade-offs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, we expertise with sovereign models like Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct may require balancing explicability versus performance, as sovereign models like Mistral 7B might not achieve the same level of performance as larger proprietary models." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, online learning from user data is prohibited due to GDPR constraints, so we will rely on offline quarterly fine-tuning on anonymized data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Another trade-off involves model size versus energy consumption. we experience with quantization methods like INT8 can help reduce the energetic footprint of we solution while maintaining comparable task performance. we will also prioritize the integration of our solution with existing systems of information and ensure that we approach contributes to reducing the environmental footprint of the city's systems of information, in line with the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ultimately, we proposal aims to provide a high level of relevance and quality of answers while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements, data protection, and environmental sustainability. we believe that we AI components and innovation strategy can effectively meet the client's needs while navigating the necessary trade-offs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The City of Belval systems of information, with a solution that contributes to reducing energetic consumption and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message18> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What is our CSR and sustainability posture for this project, and how do our propose to meet these environmental constraints?" ;
