    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the City of Belval's requirements, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. propose to design a solution that relies on Nexus Engineering S.r.l. green hosting partners and incorporates Nexus Engineering S.r.l. digital sobriety practices." ;
