        ex:hasText "CSR and sustainability goals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message18> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk158> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "**Executive Summary** Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in consortium with Nexus Engineering S.r.l. partners, proposes a comprehensive solution to implement an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance tool for the City of Belval's administrative services. proposes aligns with the City of Belval's digital transformation strategy, aiming to enhance efficiency and service quality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message19> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk159> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will design and deploy an AI-powered intelligent assistance tool that integrates with existing systems, ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements, data protection, and environmental sustainability. **Understanding of Requirements** the City of Belval's seeks to improve the City of Belval's administrative services efficiency and quality through the implementation of an AI solution. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance tool should provide intelligent assistance to municipal agents in municipal agents daily tasks, such as information search, drafting letters or answers, and file instruction. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance tool must comply with regulatory requirements, including data protection (GDPR), and minimize environmental impact. **Proposed Solution** Nexus Engineering S.r.l. consortium will design and deploy a cloud-based AI solution using SecNumCloud or equivalent infrastructure within the European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message19> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To indicative title, a time of response lower than 2 seconds is expected for the current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk160> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The technical architecture will be based on Docker and Kubernetes (k8s), ensuring scalability and security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message19> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk161> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will utilize Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) technology, specifically the Mistral 7B Instruct model, which can be fine-tuned to provide contextualized answers. the Mistral 7B Instruct model, which can be fine-tuned to provide contextualized answers will assist with drafting administrative contents and provide suggestions for actions or steps in administrative processes. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance tool will integrate with existing systems of information, including business software, electronic document management (EDM), and user directories, using API gateways and GraphQL, REST, and SOAP protocols." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message19> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk162> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will ensure data protection by hosting data exclusively within the European Union, with no transfers outside the European Union, and protecting sensitive data through encryption or anonymization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message19> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk163> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. project management methodology will follow Prince2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE frameworks, ensuring governance practices such as RAID logs, decision logs, change request processes, and steering committees." ;
