    <http://example.org/node/chunk166> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. pricing model will be based on a combination of fixed and variable costs, with a target gross margin percentage of 28% and a minimum acceptable margin percentage of 18%. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance tool will contribute to reducing the environmental footprint of the City of Belval's systems of information by utilizing green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, which use 100% renewable energy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message19> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk167> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will also implement digital sobriety practices, including auto-scaling down to zero out of business hours and query result caching. **Unaddressed Requirements** None of the requirements from the tender were left unaddressed by Our consortium. **Conclusion** Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in consortium with Nexus Engineering S.r.l. partners, is confident that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. proposed solution meets the City of Belval's requirements for an AI-powered intelligent assistance tool." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message19> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk168> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. solution will enhance efficiency and service quality while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements, data protection, and environmental sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message19> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk169> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. look forward to the opportunity to collaborate with the City of Belval's and contribute to the City of Belval's digital transformation strategy. **Budget Breakdown** * Total budget: €3,000,000 * Annual cost of exploitation: compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority * Standard daily rate: €550-€1,050 * Pricing model: combination of fixed and variable costs * Target gross margin percentage: 28% * Minimum acceptable margin percentage: 18% **Technical Specifications** * Cloud infrastructure: SecNumCloud or equivalent within the European Union * Technical architecture: Docker and Kubernetes (k8s) * AI technology: Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) with Mistral 7B Instruct model * Integration protocols: API gateways, GraphQL, REST, and SOAP * Data protection: encryption or anonymization of sensitive data, hosting exclusively within the European Union **Environmental Sustainability** * Green hosting partners: OVHcloud and Scaleway * Digital sobriety practices: auto-scaling down to zero out of business hours, query result caching * Renewable energy usage: 100%" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message19> .

